:EPARML.
:H4.Part 3&colon. Lock state
:P.Also accepted&colon. *EXCL, *EXCLRD, *SHRUPD, *SHRNUP, *SHRRD.
:H4.Part 4&colon. Member
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*FIRST:EPK.
:PD.The first one.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='ALCOBJ/WAIT'.Wait time (seconds) (WAIT)
:P.The wait time (seconds) for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*CLS:EPK.
:PD.The value of the class.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a number of up to 5 digits. The value must be from 0 to 32767.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='ALCOBJ/SCOPE'.Lock scope (SCOPE)
:P.The lock scope for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*JOB:EPK.
:PD.The value of the job.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *LCKSPC, *THREAD.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='ALCOBJ/CONFLICT'.Lock conflict (CONFLICT)
:P.The lock conflict for this command.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
:PARML.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *RQSRLS.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=CHGDTAARA.Change Data Area (CHGDTAARA)
:P.Use the Change Data Area (CHGDTAARA) command to change all or part of
a data area's value.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGDTAARA/DTAARA'.Data area specification (DTAARA)
:P.The data area, by name and library.
:P.A value is required.
:P.The value has 2 parts, given in order&colon.
:H4.Part 1&colon. Data area
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Library&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*LIBL:EPK.
:PD.The library list of the job is searched; the first match is used.
:PT.:PK.*CURLIB:EPK.
:PD.The current library of the job. When the job has none, QGPL is used.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:H4.Part 2&colon. Substring
:P.The value has 2 parts, given in order&colon.
:H4.Part 1&colon. Start position
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 1 to 2000.
:EPARML.
:H4.Part 2&colon. Length
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 1 to 2000.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGDTAARA/VALUE'.New value (VALUE)
:P.The new value for this command.
:P.A value is required.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.hexadecimal-value:EPV.
:PD.Type the value as characters or as hexadecimal digits in X'...'.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=CHGLIB.Change Library (CHGLIB)
:P.Use the Change Library (CHGLIB) command to change a library's type,
text and creation defaults.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGLIB/LIB'.Library (LIB)
:P.The library for this command.
:P.A value is required.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGLIB/TYPE'.Library type (TYPE)
:P.The library type for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *PROD, *TEST.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGLIB/TEXT'.Description (TEXT)
:P.A short description of the object, up to 50 characters, shown by the
work-with and display commands next to its name.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The text does not change.
:PT.:PK.*BLANK:EPK.
:PD.No text.
:PT.:PV.character-value:EPV.
:PD.Type up to 50 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGLIB/CRTAUT'.Authority for new objects (CRTAUT)
:P.The authority for new objects for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*SYSVAL:EPK.
:PD.The value of the system value that holds the default.
:PT.:PK.*CHANGE:EPK.
:PD.Change authority&colon. all data authorities and operational
authority. The object can be used and its contents changed.
:PT.:PK.*ALL:EPK.
:PD.All of them.
:PT.:PK.*USE:EPK.
:PD.Use authority&colon. the object can be read and run but not changed.
:PT.:PK.*EXCLUDE:EPK.
:PD.No authority&colon. the object cannot be used.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGLIB/CRTOBJAUD'.Auditing for new objects (CRTOBJAUD)
:P.The auditing value given to objects created in the library.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*SYSVAL:EPK.
:PD.The value of the system value that holds the default.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:PT.:PK.*USRPRF:EPK.
:PD.The value of the user profile the job runs under.
:PT.:PK.*CHANGE:EPK.
:PD.Change authority&colon. all data authorities and operational
authority. The object can be used and its contents changed.
:PT.:PK.*ALL:EPK.
:PD.All of them.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=CHGOBJD.Change Object Description (CHGOBJD)
:P.Use the Change Object Description (CHGOBJD) command to change an
object's text description.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGOBJD/OBJ'.Object (OBJ)
:P.The object or objects the command works on, by name and library.
:P.A value is required.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Library&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*LIBL:EPK.
:PD.The library list of the job is searched; the first match is used.
:PT.:PK.*CURLIB:EPK.
:PD.The current library of the job. When the job has none, QGPL is used.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGOBJD/OBJTYPE'.Object type (OBJTYPE)
:P.The type or types of the objects the command works on.
:P.A value is required.
