:P.The auxiliary storage pool the object is put in.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 1 to 32.
:EPARML.
:P.When no value is given, 1 is used.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CRTLIB/ASPDEV'.ASP device (ASPDEV)
:P.The auxiliary storage pool device the command works in&colon. the
