:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=RCLSTG.Reclaim Storage (RCLSTG)
:P.Use the Reclaim Storage (RCLSTG) command to reclaim storage; the
system must be in the restricted state.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='RCLSTG/SELECT'.Select (SELECT)
:P.The select for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*ALL:EPK.
:PD.All of them.
:PT.:PK.*DIR:EPK.
:PD.A directory.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *DBXREF.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='RCLSTG/OMIT'.Omit (OMIT)
:P.The omit for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:PT.:PK.*DIR:EPK.
:PD.A directory.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *DBXREF.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='RCLSTG/ASPDEV'.ASP device (ASPDEV)
:P.The auxiliary storage pool device the command works in&colon. the
system ASP and basic user ASPs, or an independent ASP group.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SYSBAS:EPK.
:PD.The system ASP and the basic user ASPs.
:PT.:PK.*ALL:EPK.
:PD.All of them.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='RCLSTG/ESTIMATE'.Estimate only (ESTIMATE)
:P.Whether to estimate only.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*NO:EPK.
:PD.No.
:PT.:PK.*YES:EPK.
:PD.Yes.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=RCLTMPSTG.Reclaim Temporary Storage (RCLTMPSTG)
:P.Use the Reclaim Temporary Storage (RCLTMPSTG) command to free the
temporary storage no job holds any more.
:P.The command has no parameters.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=RNMOBJ.Rename Object (RNMOBJ)
:P.Use the Rename Object (RNMOBJ) command to rename an object within its
library.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='RNMOBJ/OBJ'.Object (OBJ)
:P.The object or objects the command works on, by name and library.
:P.A value is required.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Library&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*LIBL:EPK.
:PD.The library list of the job is searched; the first match is used.
:PT.:PK.*CURLIB:EPK.
:PD.The current library of the job. When the job has none, QGPL is used.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
